    "appearance": "An old but radiant and delicate looking crick elf.",
    "backstory": "She to live in the Calm Ring, and has adventured all the way to the Stone Ring. However, something happened and she ended up back in the Outer Ring. She doesn\u2019t remember how because the memories of how she got there and how to escape the Outer Ring were stolen from her in the Hall of Memories. All she knows is it was something horrible, because she has an irrational fear of that place. She also has a severe limp and has to walk with a cane most of the time, indicating that her leg was severely broken at some point and never healed right.\n\nThis can be either true or a total cover story, depending on how I feel like playing it. She may genuinely believe that her memories are stored somewhere in the central chamber, or she may think there\u2019s gold there.",
